@state-diagram "주문 상태 - state acceptance"
initial-state Start @pos(30, 40)
composite-state Active @pos(150, 40) @size(450, 300) {
  state Inside @pos(200, 100) @size(220, 100)
}
state Outside @pos(720, 80) @size(220, 100)
final-state End @pos(1040, 120)
Start --> Inside : created
Inside --> Outside : cancel - 취소 요청
Outside --> End : closed
